virglrenderer and libepoxy, as built by beanjar-vendor (virglrenderer/)

These libraries are virglrenderer (https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/virgl/virglrenderer) and
libepoxy (https://github.com/anholt/libepoxy) at the commits named in BUILDINFO, with the patches
in beanjar-vendor's virglrenderer/patches/ applied, built by the build script next to them.

